<title>USA: L'Anse Creuse, Mich., repriced, top yield 5.40 pct.</title>
<headline>L'Anse Creuse, Mich., repriced, top yield 5.40 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEREN Securities Inc. said Tuesday it repriced L'Anse Creuse Public Schools, Mich.'s $93 million bond deal. The top yield at the repricing was 5.40 percent in 2017.</p>
